  "prefLabel": "Mhp 310.01 Fee Schedule",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mhp 310.01 Fee Schedule.\n\n(a) The application processing and licensing fees for professions regulated under RSA 330-A shall be the fees as required in Plc 1002.29.\n\n(b) The fee for the jurisprudence examination described in Mhp 311 shall be the fee required by Plc 1004.\n\n(c) The fee for review of a candidate for licensure agreement, including supervision agreements, where such approval is required by applicable law, shall be the fee required by Plc 1001.20.\n\nSource. #10857, eff 6-24-15 (from Mhp 303.01); ss by #13903, eff 5-14-24 (formerly Mhp 309.01); ss by #14464, eff 2-17-26, EXPIRES 2-17-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mhp300.html"
